r, including self-force and finite-size effects, are included?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0025"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:85dc97afbed44456d34efb0d8786126ed2ad9021e9ad062b7f0b337df72b7e72","title":"How does a P^2 hybrid base change characteristic widths and logarithmic distance scales relative to P^1 hybrids?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0028"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:85ba794846b08252f8fa6125a5e3199dff8f8c4376865a20df555df7e6b78fc6","title":"How far may a scalar move while a low-energy theory coupled to gravity remains valid? The conjectural rationale is that large target-space distances produce an exponentially light tower that invalidates the truncated effective action.","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0036"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:850c29f54e32d2a856365f4591f54b68ada0145a45e1fcd94ee70a84d627998a","title":"How can the full Hodge filtration on primitive middle cohomology be represented near a Calabi–Yau fourfold degeneration where several local complex-structure coordinates approach i∞?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0046"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:85e8b9bbf5d0de24383b8ffdd0af3525f87d72222af7b50ece046ca71e2767f3","title":"Which modular invariants refine the lattice-and-Φ classification of branches of 4D N=2 Heterotic–IIA dual vacua, determine geometric topology, and sometimes distinguish diffeomorphic Calabi–Yau threefolds with different Kähler cones?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0048"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:8578ab34ce34220d6991dd92420cd7d056ecad3a8d7b607ab496f5064a5122c8","title":"Can gravity on a (d+1)-dimensional AdS wedge admit a codimension-two CFT dual on its (d−1)-dimensional corner, and do free energy, anomal